    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>Elderly removals in the UK cost from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }} with Chayce, and a one-hour Discovery Consultation is &pound;150. Every removal is fully insured, staff are DBS-checked, and one coordinator manages sorting, packing, the move and settling in. We are open Monday to Friday, 09:00 to 17:30.</p></div>
